Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,920] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 15 | Text: 钱不是赚来的 老铁们不要乖自己不努力了
Segment #2   [00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:07,360] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 17 | Text: 钱是你帮别人解决问题以后对方给你的回报
Segment #3   [00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:10,900] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 18 | Text: 别人能给你多少钱 决于你帮别人解决问题的多少
Segment #4   [00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,900] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 13 | Text: 我感觉赚钱它就跟全是一个道理
Segment #5   [00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,980] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是核心招式真的很少的
Segment #6   [00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,960] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 因为动作越少 效果越好
Segment #7   [00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,960] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 12 | Text: 真正厉害的招数其实你就很简单
Segment #8   [00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,880] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 你就把这件事给它做到极致
Segment #9   [00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,500] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 16 | Text: 你在一个专业的领域上 在一个底上你去深耕
Segment #10  [00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,240] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 14 | Text: 就很牛逼了 你别我今天刷啥短视频
Segment #11  [00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:30,820] | Elapsed:  31.51s | Words: 20 | Text: 我要拍段子 明天那组料链不错 我要去开个组料链
Segment #12  [00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:34,480] | Elapsed:  31.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 会赚钱的人一定是换钱
Segment #13  [00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,720] | Elapsed:  31.51s | Words: 14 | Text: 就是你把知识换成钱 把流量换成钱
Segment #14  [00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,240] | Elapsed:  31.51s | Words: 14 | Text: 把你从书上看的 朋友讲的 老实说的
Segment #15  [00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,720] | Elapsed:  31.51s | Words: 10 | Text: 老板告诉你的 视频上的所有的
Segment #16  [00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,600] | Elapsed:  31.51s | Words: 13 | Text: 凡是有价值的东西都换成了钱
Segment #17  [00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,860] | Elapsed:  31.51s | Words: 10 | Text: 赚大钱其实它就是解决人性
Segment #18  [00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,040] | Elapsed:  31.51s | Words: 11 | Text: 你看我们按照人性制造分一分
Segment #19  [00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:53,560] | Elapsed:  31.51s | Words: 14 | Text: 它能分为什么 色 懒 贪 恐惧 欲望 好奇
Segment #20  [00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:56,540] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 15 | Text: 那抖音这些跳舞的 擦鞭的这些女主
Segment #21  [00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:57,880] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 她为什么能赚到你的钱
Segment #22  [00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:59,260] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为她抓住了你的色
Segment #23  [00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:01,680] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 12 | Text: 那开彩标链的 为什么能赚到你的钱
Segment #24  [00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,120] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为她抓住了你的贪
Segment #25  [00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:05,260] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 11 | Text: 你看这些外面平台 网络平台
Segment #26  [00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:06,380] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 她为什么能赚到你的钱
Segment #27  [00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:07,800] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为她抓住了你的懒
Segment #28  [00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:09,740] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 其实你能适应多少的人性
Segment #29  [00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:11,240] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 你就能赚到多少人的钱
Segment #30  [00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:13,480] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 然后你能反自己多少人性
Segment #31  [00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:15,380] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 你就会拥有多大的成就
Segment #32  [00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:17,120] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 5  | Text: 一定要学会解释
Segment #33  [00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,780] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 7  | Text: 穷人总是在忙事
Segment #34  [00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:20,900] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 而富人却是在忙事
Segment #35  [00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:23,340] | Elapsed:  50.01s | Words: 11 | Text: 聪明人会顺势 智者会造势
Segment #36  [00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:24,240] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 智者会巨势
Segment #37  [00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,200] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 8  | Text: 有四种钱特别好赚
Segment #38  [00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,860] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 8  | Text: 第一种 赚认知差的钱
Segment #39  [00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:30,320] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是我知道的你不知道
Segment #40  [00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:32,220] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 10 | Text: 我知道有个东西哪里能买到
Segment #41  [00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:33,080] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 2  | Text: 你不知道
Segment #42  [00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,940] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 8  | Text: 我把它买过来卖给你
Segment #43  [00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:36,380] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就能赚你钱
Segment #44  [00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:38,400] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 10 | Text: 然后第二种 就是赚认知差的钱
Segment #45  [00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,120] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是我懂的东西你不懂
Segment #46  [00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:42,920] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 14 | Text: 我知道传统实体和互联网的区别在哪
Segment #47  [00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,180] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 你满脑子想的是
Segment #48  [00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:46,380] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 9  | Text: 如何投资KDM卖产品
Segment #49  [00:01:46,380 --> 00:01:48,280] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 12 | Text: 而我做互联网我一分钱不投
Segment #50  [00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:50,040] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 10 | Text: 我每天都是在空手套白了
Segment #51  [00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,400] | Elapsed:  68.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 你看这是不是认知差
Segment #52  [00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:53,140] | Elapsed:  87.03s | Words: 9  | Text: 那互联网它就是空手套
Segment #53  [00:01:53,140 --> 00:01:55,360] | Elapsed:  87.03s | Words: 10 | Text: 你比方说现在的贷货主国
Segment #54  [00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,560] | Elapsed:  87.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 货不是它生产的
Segment #55  [00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,760] | Elapsed:  87.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 打包物流发货不需要
Segment #56  [00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,920] | Elapsed:  87.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 它发客服也不用它管
Segment #57  [00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,720] | Elapsed:  87.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 它只需要动动嘴
Segment #58  [00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,000] | Elapsed:  87.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 它就能把钱赚了
Segment #59  [00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,060] | Elapsed:  87.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 那流量也不是它的
Segment #60  [00:02:03,060 --> 00:02:04,060] | Elapsed:  87.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 那是人家赌赢的
Segment #61  [00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:05,300] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 4  | Text: 是不是这个道理
Segment #62  [00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:06,300] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后还有第三种
Segment #63  [00:02:06,300 --> 00:02:07,560] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是赚执行力的钱
Segment #64  [00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,260] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是我知道的你也知道
Segment #65  [00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:10,480] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是你没有去做
Segment #66  [00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:11,820] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 4  | Text: 我去做了
Segment #67  [00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:13,400] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后还有就是第四种
Segment #68  [00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,560] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是赚核心技能力的钱
Segment #69  [00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,880] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是你懂的我也懂
Segment #70  [00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:19,100] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是我就是比你做的更优秀
Segment #71  [00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:20,680] | Elapsed:  87.04s | Words: 11 | Text: 我公开给你学你也学不会
Segment #72  [00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:22,360] | Elapsed: 106.72s | Words: 8  | Text: 还得捞出我一本书
Segment #73  [00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,780] | Elapsed: 106.72s | Words: 7  | Text: 叫还得捞的管理
Segment #74  [00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:24,520] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 5  | Text: 你永远学不会
Segment #75  [00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,180] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 这本书你们可以去看一看
Segment #76  [00:02:26,180 --> 00:02:27,620] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 6  | Text: 每本书真不贵
Segment #77  [00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:29,000] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 好像是四十多块钱
Segment #78  [00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,440] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 8  | Text: 五十多块钱我忘了
Segment #79  [00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,980] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是花钱能够学的东西
Segment #80  [00:02:31,980 --> 00:02:32,620] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 3  | Text: 你就去学
Segment #81  [00:02:32,620 --> 00:02:34,020] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 花钱能搞定的问题
Segment #82  [00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:35,720] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 9  | Text: 你就找专业的人去帮你搞
Segment #83  [00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:38,480] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 13 | Text: 你千万别自己折腾你不擅长的事
Segment #84  [00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,440] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 4  | Text: 那样真的很傻
Segment #85  [00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,860] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 6  | Text: 真正能搞钱的人
Segment #86  [00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:41,920] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 6  | Text: 他都不是全能的
Segment #87  [00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:42,960] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 4  | Text: 你搞不到钱
Segment #88  [00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,500] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后你天天想来
Segment #89  [00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:45,400] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 4  | Text: 我要准备好了
Segment #90  [00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,100] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 7  | Text: 我要等万事具备了
Segment #91  [00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:48,680] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 10 | Text: 所有的点我都准备齐全了
Segment #92  [00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,000] | Elapsed: 106.73s | Words: 10 | Text: 我再出发我再去做生意
Segment #93  [00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,040] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 4  | Text: 总有借口
Segment #94  [00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:52,640] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 9  | Text: 一晃这一辈子就过去了
Segment #95  [00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,060] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 6  | Text: 会搞钱的人都是什么
Segment #96  [00:02:54,060 --> 00:02:55,200] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是我看到机会
Segment #97  [00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:55,900] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 5  | Text: 我马上行动
Segment #98  [00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:57,020] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 6  | Text: 我边做边调整
Segment #99  [00:02:57,020 --> 00:02:58,460] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 7  | Text: 出来碰最要紧的是出来
Segment #100 [00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,300] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 7  | Text: 他也不会去研究一些
Segment #101 [00:03:00,300 --> 00:03:01,580] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 6  | Text: 假大空的东西
Segment #102 [00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:02,840] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 6  | Text: 反而去研究什么
Segment #103 [00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,660] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 7  | Text: 小而具体的东西
Segment #104 [00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:06,640] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 8  | Text: 小东西你研究明白了
Segment #105 [00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:08,120] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 7  | Text: 大东西也就透了
Segment #106 [00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:09,540] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 6  | Text: 你想要寻找商机
Segment #107 [00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:10,340] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就不要去做
Segment #108 [00:03:10,340 --> 00:03:11,620] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 9  | Text: 任何天马行动的想法
Segment #109 [00:03:12,180 --> 00:03:14,260] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 10 | Text: 我现在我转型做互占公司
Segment #110 [00:03:14,260 --> 00:03:15,420] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就是因为看到了
Segment #111 [00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:17,220] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 6  | Text: 有很多不如我的人
Segment #112 [00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:18,960] | Elapsed: 124.44s | Words: 9  | Text: 那老板往这一说话都
Segment #113 [00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,780] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 可能形容的有点夸张
Segment #114 [00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,880] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是话都说不明白的人
Segment #115 [00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:27,680] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 7  | Text: 他都能做得非常好
Segment #116 [00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,720] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 我就感觉这就是好行业
Segment #117 [00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,860] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 其实我给你们聊一下
Segment #118 [00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:33,280] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 我选行业的一些标准
Segment #119 [00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,200] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 2  | Text: 首先第一
Segment #120 [00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,120] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 我要找到赚钱的行业
Segment #121 [00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,080] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 2  | Text: 然后第二
Segment #122 [00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,620] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 我看这个行业里
Segment #123 [00:03:38,620 --> 00:03:39,640] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 哪些人做得好
Segment #124 [00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:41,100] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 他是怎么做的
Segment #125 [00:03:41,580 --> 00:03:42,620] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 我要怎么去抄
Segment #126 [00:03:42,620 --> 00:03:43,680] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 怎么去学习
Segment #127 [00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,640] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 怎么去复制
Segment #128 [00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:45,500] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 3  | Text: 加粘贴
Segment #129 [00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:47,860] | Elapsed: 138.64s | Words: 5  | Text: 而且抄这个东西
Segment #130 [00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,060] | Elapsed: 149.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 你不能光抄
Segment #131 [00:03:49,060 --> 00:03:49,700] | Elapsed: 149.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 你得会改
Segment #132 [00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:51,600] | Elapsed: 149.60s | Words: 8  | Text: 你要抄得比他很牛逼
Segment #133 [00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:52,640] | Elapsed: 149.60s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后第三个点是什么
Segment #134 [00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,460] | Elapsed: 149.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 第三个点就是
Segment #135 [00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:54,960] | Elapsed: 149.60s | Words: 4  | Text: 我能不能做
Segment #136 [00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,560] | Elapsed: 149.60s | Words: 9  | Text: 我能不能做得比你更好
Segment #137 [00:03:56,900 --> 00:03:58,460] | Elapsed: 149.60s | Words: 11 | Text: 你们也就记得这三个点就完了
